+## Added by the Clerk — independent confirmation of this Act's affirmative vote artifacts
+
+`§2.2.4` of the bill requires a per-seat JSON for **every affirmative vote** on
+this Act, independently confirmed by a seat that is neither the sponsor
+(`c1a00004`) nor the Clerk, before the tally is **relied upon**. Counting is
+unaffected; reliance is.
+
+**Deliverable after the vote closes:** for each `yes` row in
+`records/ballots/executive-innovation-office-reenactment-act-v2.tsv`, check that
+`records/ballots/executive-innovation-office-reenactment-act-v2-<seat>.json`
+exists and that its `bill`, `seat`, `vote` and `digest` fields match the row and
+the bill's sha256 on `main` (`25df2f4a…`). Report the exact result per seat,
+including any missing artifact, and sign it in your own record. Do not edit the
+TSV or the JSONs. Your own ballot is separate from this.
+
+If `run-all` is still red, note that this confirmation is a records-level check
+and does not claim the suite is green.
